{"id":"4dbcaaffe430f1dd","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-separable-pair-complexity.md","title":"c.e. 对的可计算分离指标为 Σ₃ 完全","display":"thm-separable-pair-complexity — c.e. 对的可计算分离指标为 Σ₃ 完全","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-separable-pair-complexity","aliases":["20-thm-separable-pair-complexity"],"display":"thm-separable-pair-complexity — c.e. 对的可计算分离指标为 Σ₃ 完全","chapter":"4","section":"4.3.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 4.3.13","source_printed_pages":[91],"source_pdf_pages":[127],"depends_on":["[[20-df-separator]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-separable-pair-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-separable-pair-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separable-pair-complexity — c.e. 对的可计算分离指标为 Σ₃ 完全"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 4.3.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9aaf109dea18156\" href=\"?note=d9aaf109dea18156\" title=\"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal\">20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}:=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:\\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\ [W_e\\subseteq R\\land R\\cap W_j=\\varnothing]\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}:=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:\\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\ [W_e\\subseteq R\\land R\\cap W_j=\\varnothing]\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9aaf109dea18156\" href=\"?note=d9aaf109dea18156\" title=\"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal\">20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separable-pair-complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sep}\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\ [S\\le_m\\mathrm{Sep}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separable-pair-complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sep}\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\ [S\\le_m\\mathrm{Sep}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上界用“存在全二值特征程序，所有已枚举正负实例均最终得到正确输出”，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists k\\forall x,s\\exists t\">\\(\\exists k\\forall x,s\\exists t\\)</span> 矩阵。困难性用二值移动标记部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_x\">\\(\\psi_x\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_x\">\\(U_x\\)</span> 为值 1 的输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_x\">\\(V_x\\)</span> 为值 0 的输入，统一取得两个 c.e. 索引；它们不交。可计算分离者的特征函数正好是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_x\">\\(\\psi_x\\)</span> 的全二值延伸。肯定分支有之，否定分支无之，故映射是归约。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 4.3.13；印刷页 91；PDF 第 127 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-separator]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"d9aaf109dea18156","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"d9aaf109dea18156","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}:=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:\\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\ [W_e\\subseteq R\\land R\\cap W_j=\\varnothing]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separable-pair-complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sep}\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\quad\\land\\quad\\forall S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\ [S\\le_m\\mathrm{Sep}].","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists k\\forall x,s\\exists t","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_x","display":false},{"tex":"U_x","display":false},{"tex":"V_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_x","display":false}],"bytes":1632,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-separable-pair-complexity]] — 章 4；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-separable-pair-complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["9f5c300501e65ad4","4ef1aee16db6b308","d9aaf109dea18156","8ba6597a854c206f"]}